<title>GERMANY: German Nov import prices flat m/m, up 1.4 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>German Nov import prices flat m/m, up 1.4 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN TRADE PRICES    Nov 96	Oct 96	Nov 95</p>
<p>IMPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  unch	  +0.6	 +0.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +1.4	  +1.6	 -0.6</p>
<p>    Index (base 100 1991) 98.2	  98.2	 96.8</p>
<p>EXPORT prices:</p>
<p>    Monthly figure	  -0.1	  +0.2	 -0.2</p>
<p>    Year-on-year	    +0.1	  unch	 +1.0</p>
<p>    Index(base 100 1991) 103.4	 103.5	103.3</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
